DISCLAIMER OF PROFESSIONAL ADVICE

This software is a documentation tool for foundation inspection workflows. It
does not provide engineering services, professional certification, or sealed
engineering opinions. The inspector or firm using this software is solely
responsible for the accuracy of measurements, observations, and conclusions
recorded in any report generated by this tool.

Where local jurisdiction requires sealed engineering documents for foundation
remediation, retention of a licensed Professional Engineer remains the
